1
00:00:52,280 --> 00:00:54,010
Brother Liu, it's been a while.

2
00:01:26,080 --> 00:01:27,280
Brother Liu, please.

3
00:01:28,960 --> 00:01:29,760
General Ning,

4
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:31,000
congratulations on your upcoming wedding.

5
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,130
Let's drink to that.

6
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:33,640
We are only enjoying tonight

7
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:34,840
because of this happy occasion.

8
00:01:34,840 --> 00:01:36,440
Congratulations, General.

9
00:01:37,320 --> 00:01:37,800
Indeed.

10
00:01:52,440 --> 00:01:53,800
Why does the girl in the middle

11
00:01:53,800 --> 00:01:55,360
look a bit like Keying?

12
00:01:57,440 --> 00:01:58,240
Ning Yuanci

13
00:01:58,600 --> 00:02:00,240
didn't even send me an invitation.

14
00:02:00,240 --> 00:02:01,720
I'm coming whether he likes it or not.

15
00:02:01,720 --> 00:02:02,880
Just watch me ruin

16
00:02:02,880 --> 00:02:03,640
your engagement banquet.

17
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:04,900
Why is Xue Keying here?

18
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:07,010
I never sent her an invitation.

19
00:02:07,720 --> 00:02:08,400
Young Master Chu

20
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:09,930
probably brought her here.

21
00:02:10,199 --> 00:02:11,039
I remember

22
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:12,700
that painter named Chu

23
00:02:12,720 --> 00:02:14,450
is your childhood sweetheart.

24
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:18,290
You misunderstand, General Ning.

25
00:02:18,320 --> 00:02:19,360
Chu Qingyun and I

26
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:21,000
only knew each other as children.

27
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:22,840
We studied together at the academy

28
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:24,840
and stopped seeing each other long ago.

29
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:26,120
Keying, on the other hand,

30
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:28,050
has been quite close to him lately.

31
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:30,120
My Lady, tonight...

32
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:31,920
Have you barely eaten anything?

33
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:33,620
I have no appetite.

34
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:34,880
Then I will go find

35
00:02:34,880 --> 00:02:36,610
something My Lady likes to eat.

36
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:47,600
Look!

37
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:50,240
The one dancing is my daughter.

38
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:51,120
How could she mingle

39
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:52,120
with the dancing girls?

40
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:52,920
How improper!

41
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:54,280
What do you know?

42
00:02:54,480 --> 00:02:55,640
One must show their talents

43
00:02:55,640 --> 00:02:56,900
when the time is right.

44
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:58,240
My daughter

45
00:02:58,720 --> 00:03:00,560
is truly gifted

46
00:03:01,560 --> 00:03:03,690
and as beautiful as a celestial being.

47
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:14,940
This is Lady Xue's favorite dish.

48
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:15,650
Remember

49
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:17,480
to serve it to the main table.

50
00:03:20,079 --> 00:03:20,960
Give this to me.

51
00:03:28,760 --> 00:03:30,760
Beautiful. What a wonderful dance.

52
00:03:46,440 --> 00:03:48,170
I have a few friends over there.

53
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:49,840
I will go greet them and be right back.

54
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:52,370
General, please have
a good chat with Wan'er.

55
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:59,079
It's just an engagement banquet.

56
00:03:59,079 --> 00:04:00,120
Is it worth

57
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,420
making it so grand?

58
00:04:08,720 --> 00:04:09,760
Of course it is.

59
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:27,280
How come this date cake

60
00:04:27,280 --> 00:04:28,320
tastes exactly like

61
00:04:28,320 --> 00:04:29,180
the one at home?

62
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:35,880
Okay.

63
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:37,440
Okay.

64
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:40,210
Lady Keying,

65
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:41,540
your dance just now

66
00:04:42,080 --> 00:04:43,480
was incredibly graceful.

67
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:44,680
As graceful as a swan.

68
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:46,400
I am deeply impressed

69
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:50,010
and full of admiration.

70
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:52,960
You flatter me.

71
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:56,560
Mr. Chu,

72
00:04:56,640 --> 00:04:57,840
go find Sister Wan while

73
00:04:57,840 --> 00:04:58,970
Ning Yuanci is away.

74
00:05:00,520 --> 00:05:02,080
Today is the engagement banquet
of Sister Wan

75
00:05:02,080 --> 00:05:03,320
and General Ning.

76
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:05,720
It would be inappropriate

77
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:06,520
for me to do so.

78
00:05:07,960 --> 00:05:10,160
It's just an engagement, not a wedding.

79
00:05:10,480 --> 00:05:11,880
Besides, let me tell you,

80
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:12,680
Sister Wan doesn't like

81
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:13,740
Ning Yuanci at all.

82
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:14,760
And Ning Yuanci doesn't

83
00:05:14,760 --> 00:05:16,020
care about her either.

84
00:05:16,400 --> 00:05:18,730
Do you have the heart
to watch her sit there

85
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:20,680
all alone and sad?

86
00:05:22,400 --> 00:05:23,800
Go comfort her.

87
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:26,960
That dancer sure knows how to flirt.

88
00:05:27,600 --> 00:05:29,000
She must be trying to seduce Chu Qingyun,

89
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:30,800
the most talented scholar in the capital.

90
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:32,860
Who knows where this vixen came from.

91
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:33,760
Look at her,

92
00:05:34,440 --> 00:05:35,760
barely wearing any clothes.

93
00:05:35,760 --> 00:05:36,920
And showing off at General Ning's

94
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:38,080
engagement banquet.

95
00:05:38,080 --> 00:05:39,080
Just listen to me.

96
00:05:39,159 --> 00:05:39,760
Go, go.

97
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:41,200
Hurry up.

98
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:56,920
Pick up the fan for me.

99
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,400
It was just a bump.

100
00:05:58,440 --> 00:05:59,640
Why are you so fierce?

101
00:06:06,280 --> 00:06:07,120
What do you mean?

102
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:08,280
How dare a lowly dancer like you

103
00:06:08,280 --> 00:06:09,600
bump into me!

104
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:13,250
Whose daughter are you?

105
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:14,520
General Ning,

106
00:06:14,760 --> 00:06:16,280
My father is Commander Li,

107
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:19,000
who oversees conscription
under your command.

108
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:19,680
This shrew

109
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:21,640
struck me first just now.

110
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:24,040
I had no choice but to fight back.

111
00:06:24,520 --> 00:06:25,360
Do you know

112
00:06:26,520 --> 00:06:27,980
that the shrew you speak of

113
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:31,200
is the Second Lady of the Duke's Estate?

114
00:06:31,840 --> 00:06:33,120
My fiancée

115
00:06:33,159 --> 00:06:34,360
is her eldest sister.

116
00:06:36,400 --> 00:06:37,730
It seems your father...

117
00:06:37,960 --> 00:06:39,290
It will take a long time.

118
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:41,320
I'll teach you a lesson when we get home.

119
00:06:41,320 --> 00:06:41,960
Tomorrow,

120
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:45,440
I will make him retire
and return to his hometown.

121
00:06:45,440 --> 00:06:46,240
General Ning,

122
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:47,400
I know I was wrong.

123
00:06:51,960 --> 00:06:54,120
I know how to act
in the face-slapping scene.

124
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:56,159
Who asked you to play
the hero saving the beauty?

125
00:06:56,159 --> 00:06:57,960
What exactly are you trying to do

126
00:06:58,240 --> 00:07:00,040
by putting on this show tonight?

127
00:07:01,080 --> 00:07:04,160
I wasn't trying to do anything.

128
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:06,400
I'm just here for the fun.

129
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:08,000
Didn't I tell you that

130
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:09,800
except for marriage,

131
00:07:10,280 --> 00:07:11,120
I can give you

132
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:12,180
whatever you want?

133
00:07:13,280 --> 00:07:14,600
I didn't ask you for anything.

134
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:16,600
And I don't want to marry you either.

135
00:07:16,960 --> 00:07:17,680
I just hope

136
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:19,280
you stay away from Xue Ruowan

137
00:07:19,280 --> 00:07:21,210
so I can smoothly reach the finale.

138
00:07:21,840 --> 00:07:24,320
The fireworks show starts now.

139
00:07:33,520 --> 00:07:34,240
Don't interact with

140
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:35,500
that painter anymore.

141
00:07:35,880 --> 00:07:36,400
I can still

142
00:07:36,400 --> 00:07:37,730
treat you like I used to.

143
00:07:38,440 --> 00:07:39,360
What did you say?

144
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:40,520
There are fireworks over there.

145
00:07:40,520 --> 00:07:41,320
So beautiful.

146
00:07:41,400 --> 00:07:43,000
Hurry up and grab a good spot.

147
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,930
Who told you to add a kissing scene?

148
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:18,320
My Lady,

149
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:20,280
are you alright? My Lady!

150
00:08:20,280 --> 00:08:20,880
My Lady!

151
00:08:21,800 --> 00:08:22,660
Somebody come!

152
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:23,880
My Lady has fainted!

153
00:08:24,640 --> 00:08:25,520
Help!

154
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:27,440
Oh no. Xue Ruowan!

155
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:29,680
My Lady!

156
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:30,480
What is going on here?

157
00:08:30,480 --> 00:08:31,340
Somebody help!

158
00:08:31,880 --> 00:08:32,539
Xue Ruowan!

159
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:33,720
What happened?

160
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:35,640
My Lady suddenly fainted just now.

161
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:37,440
It seems she has been poisoned.

162
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:38,770
She's poisoned.

163
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:39,960
My Lady,

164
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:41,480
wake up! My Lady!

165
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:41,919
Wan'er.

166
00:08:41,919 --> 00:08:43,179
Get some water, quick!

167
00:08:43,480 --> 00:08:44,080
My Lady,

168
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:45,200
wake up!

169
00:08:45,560 --> 00:08:46,840
Don't scare me.

170
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:49,080
My Lady.

171
00:08:49,920 --> 00:08:50,440
Wan'er.

172
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:00,600
My Lady.

173
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:02,000
My Lady,

174
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:02,930
are you alright?

175
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:05,240
My Lady.

176
00:09:07,880 --> 00:09:08,560
Summon the imperial physician!

177
00:09:08,560 --> 00:09:10,040
She passed out again.

178
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:13,640
My Lady!

179
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:47,600
Mother,

180
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:48,720
come with me.

181
00:09:48,800 --> 00:09:49,440
What is it?

182
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:50,400
Hurry!

183
00:09:54,160 --> 00:09:54,960
What's wrong?

184
00:09:58,080 --> 00:09:59,440
Did you do this?

185
00:10:00,800 --> 00:10:02,000
Don't talk nonsense.

186
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:04,400
I just saw you

187
00:10:04,400 --> 00:10:06,460
and Nanny Zhao acting suspiciously.

188
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:07,960
Dare you say

189
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:08,720
you have nothing to do

190
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:09,920
with these pastries?

191
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:10,520
I...

192
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:16,560
I just added a little cold-inducing poison

193
00:10:16,560 --> 00:10:18,360
to the pastries.

194
00:10:19,040 --> 00:10:19,920
I only wanted her

195
00:10:19,920 --> 00:10:21,320
to catch a minor illness.

196
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:22,370
If she gets sick,

197
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:23,440
wouldn't you have a chance

198
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:24,840
to be with Ning Yuanci?

199
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:28,160
How many times have I told you?

200
00:10:28,400 --> 00:10:29,720
Stop persecuting her.

201
00:10:30,160 --> 00:10:31,160
Why are you acting like an NPC

202
00:10:31,160 --> 00:10:32,890
inserted by the scriptwriter?

203
00:10:33,160 --> 00:10:33,600
What?

204
00:10:34,280 --> 00:10:35,760
I don't understand the nonsense

205
00:10:35,760 --> 00:10:36,620
you're saying.

206
00:10:37,680 --> 00:10:38,600
Let me tell you,

207
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:40,890
this cold-inducing poison

208
00:10:40,920 --> 00:10:42,000
is not fatal.

209
00:10:43,760 --> 00:10:45,560
If I wanted to kill that little wretch,

210
00:10:45,560 --> 00:10:47,000
I would have done it long ago.

211
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:48,320
Why wait until now?

212
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:51,920
Then swear

213
00:10:52,160 --> 00:10:53,620
you are telling the truth.

214
00:10:56,520 --> 00:10:57,120
Fine.

215
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:58,680
I swear.

216
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:00,840
If I tell a single lie,

217
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:02,640
you can disown me,

218
00:11:03,240 --> 00:11:04,360
and leave me uncared for

219
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:05,090
in my old age.

220
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:06,600
Is that enough?

221
00:11:08,280 --> 00:11:09,000
Alright.

222
00:11:12,280 --> 00:11:13,400
Madam Qin shouldn't have

223
00:11:13,400 --> 00:11:15,200
the guts to kill someone in public.

224
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:17,460
What exactly is going on with Xue Ruowan?

225
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:19,080
Reporting to the Duke and Madam.

226
00:11:19,080 --> 00:11:20,760
The imperial physician says
the Eldest Lady is severely poisoned

227
00:11:20,760 --> 00:11:22,240
and is receiving acupuncture
and bloodletting.

228
00:11:22,240 --> 00:11:23,300
Is it that serious?

229
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:24,720
Didn't you say it wouldn't be fatal?

230
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:25,440
Who

231
00:11:25,920 --> 00:11:27,050
harmed my daughter?

232
00:11:27,440 --> 00:11:28,400
H-He said

233
00:11:28,920 --> 00:11:30,120
it's a deadly poison.

234
00:11:33,960 --> 00:11:34,800
Then let's see

235
00:11:35,040 --> 00:11:36,560
who poisoned

236
00:11:36,560 --> 00:11:37,890
Xue Ruowan's pastries.

237
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:46,320
She served

238
00:11:47,360 --> 00:11:48,840
these pastries herself.

239
00:11:49,880 --> 00:11:51,210
Xue Ruowan was poisoned

240
00:11:51,520 --> 00:11:52,920
right after eating them.

241
00:11:53,400 --> 00:11:54,040
I...

242
00:11:54,640 --> 00:11:55,300
Xiaolan...

243
00:11:55,760 --> 00:11:56,600
I am here,

244
00:11:57,120 --> 00:11:58,250
so you need not fear.

245
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:01,160
Tell us what you know.

246
00:12:06,400 --> 00:12:08,480
You were the last person
to handle the pastries.
